{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-26T14:44:29.931Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"2674fa95e556dd8d429b227d","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"tests_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tests/1","value":{"command":"node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/comments-sync.test.ts test/import-ownership.test.ts test/ownership-consistency.test.ts test/import-errors.test.ts test/scoped-ownership.test.ts test/webhooks.test.ts test/workflow-diagnostic-class.test.ts test/cited-issue-adoption.test.ts test/import-lock.test.ts test/legacy-description-compatibility.test.ts test/owner-field-values.test.ts test/round-seventeen.test.ts test/round-eighteen.test.ts test/round-twelve.test.ts test/sdk-adoption.test.ts test/coverage-remainder.test.ts test/coverage-edges.test.ts test/identity-inventory.test.ts test/minimum-sdk-consumer.test.ts","scope":"project","provenance":{"author":"pi-glm","created_at":"2026-11-26T14:44:29.835Z","source_kind":"local_mutation","source_ref":"fix/linked-item-import-converges"}}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-26T14:44:29.931Z"}],"before_hash":"ef5bd2369b80b77021f67525a44ceb72c086de4a72b21ef13dadb3816f851266","after_hash":"adf7910c65ba69485be2efc7975bbc867f2b6688c35f0ae5889b5876226a2b7e","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"maintenance","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"d8f601c36d3792f33c1d35e4fabed929093f36af8ee038b589caca95bf1f1964"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-26T14:44:39.107Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"2674fa95e556dd8d429b227d","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/10","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-26T14:44:39.106Z","author":"pi-glm","text":"Revert proofs (behavioral reverts in a disposable copy, restored and re-verified green after each):\n\n- Scope revert: rendering the repair without the invocation's selector failed the tracker-scoped regression at the first assertion, with the refusal showing the bare pm update command. Restored: pass.\n- Provenance revert: dropping the post-link claims predicate made the refusal offer the link to the item carrying github_number=8, failing 'a link that would create contradictory ownership must not be offered'. Restored: pass.\n- Timestamp revert: storing comment.created_at unvalidated counted the three malformed comments as added=4/failed=0 and wrote malformed rows, failing the deep-equal. Restored: pass.\n- With all fixes restored the full linked-import regression file passes 8/8 in the disposable copy.\n\nOne existing fixture needed its comment timestamp made valid, not a weakened assertion: coverage-remainder's metadata-preservation and read-only-directory tests used created_at empty strings as don't-care values; each now carries a valid source timestamp so the same write paths are still exercised (the read-only failure still fails at the write; the metadata row still lands). The body-mode builder tests keep their empty timestamps because body text is mirrored content, not persisted metadata.\n\nGates so far: typecheck, build, test build, lint, docstring (328 declarations), duplication (34 modules, zero clones), privacy (10654 objects audited), the ownership inventory regenerated and verified (one new classified group for the repair renderer), and the packed minimum-SDK consumer (2026.10.23) passed. Focused regressions: linked-import 8/8; comments-sync/import-ownership/ownership-consistency/import-errors/scoped-ownership 208; webhooks/workflow-diagnostic/cited-adoption/import-lock/legacy-description/owner-field-values 121; round-seventeen/eighteen/twelve/sdk-adoption 41; coverage-remainder 25; identity-inventory 9; coverage-edges 9; minimum-sdk 1. A full 100-file local run was stopped at the 90-minute mark after an npm EALLOWSCRIPTS flake in strict-import-admission under two-worker concurrency; that file passes 2/2 standalone and unchanged thresholds remain for CI."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-26T14:44:39.107Z"}],"before_hash":"adf7910c65ba69485be2efc7975bbc867f2b6688c35f0ae5889b5876226a2b7e","after_hash":"9701dfee3dff994ef0850a5f3e529e1d1a54fd3298a5524a6c48e8b3f52e6c96","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"b4499f48719a2dbba9490fcbf54d850775544fad5035ca9180adcc786238525f"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-26T14:50:29.390Z","author":"pi-glm","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"2674fa95e556dd8d429b227d","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/11","value":{"created_at":"2026-11-26T14:50:29.390Z","author":"pi-glm","text":"Class closure beyond the named line, with two more surfaces found by the same rule search and their own revert proofs:\n\n- The comment mirror's ownership-conflict release guidance (comment-mirror.ts) also rendered an unscoped 'pm release <id>' example; it now replays the failing invocation's selector, verified by a strict-governance held-item test that fails on the unscoped revert.\n- The webhook reconcile recovery hint (webhooks.ts) rendered an unscoped 'pm github refresh <repo> --dry-run'; it now replays the selector, verified by a reconcile test asserting both the scoped and implicit forms, failing on the unscoped revert.\n\nBoth revert proofs ran in a disposable copy; with the fixes restored, the linked-import and webhook files pass 22/22, and the ownership inventory, lint, docstring (328 declarations) and duplication gates (zero clones, 34 modules) all re-passed after the additions."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-26T14:50:29.390Z"}],"before_hash":"9701dfee3dff994ef0850a5f3e529e1d1a54fd3298a5524a6c48e8b3f52e6c96","after_hash":"897692eedc99df9982430ec4fedfb5d70049c05325072b84d5ab56a2bf783b37","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"4f8e3d0ed423946de3a6cba93bc944025b75fe5f2294cea6b386e23155b705c5"}
